  "findings": [
    "The bounded forty-update fit and all 529 real-event evaluations completed. Fixed-horizon scores retain genuine per-horizon coverage; all unstable events also receive actual-available-target scores.",
    "All role numerical evaluations returned, and the saved-trajectory arithmetic audit reproduced every compared metric and classification with zero mismatches.",
    "Train, val and test contain respectively 10, 2 and 3 unsettled predictions. Full-cohort accuracies are therefore null; resolved-subset accuracies are not substitutes for them.",
    "The fixed test benchmark has TP=7, TN=49, FP=17, FN=0, with 3 unresolved and 73 resolved cases. Seven detected unstable cases do not establish full recall of all nine unstable cases.",
    "The test complete-eight-second event-mean normalized RMSE is 5.014669847823587 over 67 genuinely covered events. This is a reporting-only outcome and provides no approval to promote or retune the model.",
    "The train-only history/future log1p correlation is 0.019790761351836567. The fixed highest-residual quarter has lower mean future error than the remaining cases; the saved observations do not establish a monotonic residual-driven failure pattern.",
    "Saved hidden energy has no real hidden-state truth reference. Correlation and event-varying genuine target windows cannot identify whether initialization or the fixed visible dynamics causes the observed prediction errors.",
    "The completed next step is the authorized saved train diagnosis. The proposed controlled known-truth mechanism study remains preparation only."
  ],
  "interpretation_limits": [
    "Window-rule stability classification is not a stability certificate.",
    "The historically exposed 76-event test roster is a fixed comparison benchmark, not independent confirmation.",
    "No same-roster A06 forward baseline was newly evaluated, so no matched baseline improvement claim is made.",
    "The saved audit uses the same frozen scoring code; it replays arithmetic from saved truth/predictions rather than providing an independently implemented scoring algorithm.",
    "Initialization residual and hidden energy are summarized from the run JSON, not independently rebuilt from hidden-state arrays.",
    "The training trace final recorded loss belongs to the parameters before update 40; it is not relabeled as an update-40 terminal objective."
  ],
